sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Developer as Skill Developer / AI Agent
    participant Generator as skill_generator.py
    participant Validator as skill_validator.py
    participant Scorer as quality_scorer.py
    participant CI as CI/CD Pipeline

    Developer->>Generator: Generate initial skill folder
    Generator-->>Developer: Scaffolds 9 directories & SKILL.md
    Developer->>Validator: Validate structure & frontmatter
    Validator-->>Developer: Returns valid=True / False
    Developer->>Scorer: Evaluate 10 quality dimensions
    Scorer-->>Developer: Returns score (0-100) & Grade
    Developer->>CI: Push Pull Request
    CI->>Scorer: Execute quality gate check (--min-score 85)
    alt Score >= 85
        CI-->>Developer: PASS - PR Approved for Merge
    else Score < 85
        CI-->>Developer: FAIL - PR Blocked, remediation required
    end
